Bharata leaves mothers and vows Nandigrāma wait --- Bharata names Rāma absent king and seeks leave --- Ministers and Vasiṣṭha approve brother loving vow --- Bharata mounts chariot with Śatrughna and priests --- Army and citizens follow unbidden to Nandigrāma --- Bharata bears sandals on head into Nandigrāma --- Bharata declares kingdom trust till Rāma return --- Bharata vows to lay burden and serve after return --- Bharata rules in bark and matted hair with ministers --- Bharata consecrates sandals and reports every order
